No, it means 100% chance of resisting.

 If so, why in wizard mode is a level 25 arch-
> lich regularly shrugging off a wand of cancellation (does it have an
> MC cloak)?

Because monsters _do_ get a saving throw against cancellation.

(wan1-343.txt, or other relevant spoiler, will generally say "Some
